# ES-DE "Mangmi Air X" system: Title|command  (generated into ~/ROMs/mangmi)
Desktop Mode|exec mangmi-mode desktop
Performance - Powersave|exec mangmi-ctl perf powersave
Performance - Balanced|exec mangmi-ctl perf balanced
Performance - High|exec mangmi-ctl perf performance
Performance - Max|exec mangmi-ctl perf max
Fan - Auto|exec mangmi-ctl fan auto
Fan - Quiet|exec mangmi-ctl fan quiet
Fan - Cool|exec mangmi-ctl fan cool
Fan - Max|exec mangmi-ctl fan max
Stick Lights - Battery|exec mangmi-ctl led battery
Stick Lights - Rainbow|exec mangmi-ctl led rainbow
Stick Lights - Wave|exec mangmi-ctl led wave
Stick Lights - Breath|exec mangmi-ctl led breath
Stick Lights - Static|exec mangmi-ctl led static
Stick Lights - Temperature|exec mangmi-ctl led thermal
Stick Lights - Off|exec mangmi-ctl led off
System Update|exec foot -e mangmi-update
